    "main_topic": [
      {
        "h_title": "Where to stay in Ayutthaya",
        "main_title": "Where to stay in Ayutthaya",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 1,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "The Soi Farang backpacker strip, or Naresuan Soi 1, is the place for travellers looking to meet, mix and party. Sound systems thump late into the night at the heart of the strip, but a couple of our favourite spots towards the north end stay reasonably quiet -- we even saw families staying at Chanthana House and Baan Lotus. If you seek the best selection of flashpacker-range options plus some good, quiet budget choices, head west up Naresuan Road to the area stretching between Soi Farang and the Historical Park. Some guesthouses, like Good Morning by Tamarind, are strategically situated roughly in the middle. Others, like The Park Ayutthaya, are practically on top of the ruins.\nAn increasing number of places to stay are found along the riverfront, mostly towards the east of the island along the Prasak River and to the southwest along the Chao Phraya. These seem inconvenient at first glance, but the ruins aren't too far if going by bicycle. If looking to relax, head to the riverfront or go further afield to a traditional Thai homestay in Ban Lan Khe.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Our recommended areas of Ayutthaya to stay in",
        "main_title": "Where to stay in Ayutthaya",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 2,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Select which area you’re interested in to browse Travelfish’s recommended hotels, guesthouses, and other places to stay in that area of Ayutthaya.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Soi Farang",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Between Soi Farang and the Historical Park",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Where to stay in Ayutthaya",
        "main_title": "Where to stay in Ayutthaya",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "A bunch of quality flashpacker options and even a true luxury resort have joined Ayutthaya’s long-running stable of budget guesthouses in recent years, resulting in terrific value across the board. Booking sites list more than 70 places to stay, which doesn’t include the many cheap guesthouses relying on the walk-in trade. Need some direction? Check out our top picks right here for where to... Read our full story.",
            "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/bangkok_and_surrounds/ayutthaya/ayutthaya/all/6775",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/bangkok_and_surrounds/ayutthaya/ayutthaya/all/6775",
                "anchor_text": "... Read our full story."
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Where to stay in Ayutthaya",
            "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/bangkok_and_surrounds/ayutthaya/ayutthaya/all/6775",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/bangkok_and_surrounds/ayutthaya/ayutthaya/all/6775",
                "anchor_text": "Where to stay in Ayutthaya"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Soi Farang",
        "main_title": "Where to stay in Ayutthaya",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 2,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Also known as Naresuan Soi 1 and Pamaprao Soi 5, depending on which road you approach from, Soi Farang has long been Ayutthaya’s budget traveller strip. The name translates as “Foreigner Street”—look elsewhere if you prefer a local vibe.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "While it doesn’t reach even close to the party atmosphere of Khao San Road, you will find similar traveller-oriented bars and restaurants. The historical park is within fairly easy bicycling distance and loads of traveller services are at your fingertips. When you do feel like hanging around the locals, simply walk across Naresuan Road to the bustling Chao Phrom Market.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Baan Lotus",
        "main_title": "Where to stay in Ayutthaya",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Stepping onto the grounds of Baan Lotus is like being swept off to a country homestay despite the fact that Soi Farang is just around the corner. Cats snooze in the shade of broad tamarind trees. Old gardening equipment leans against a shed in the spacious lawn. Travellers read in pavilions and hammocks spread over a walkway raised above a pond filled with fountains and lotuses. The elderly... Read our full review of Baan Lotus including room rates and direct contact details.",
            "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/bangkok_and_surrounds/ayutthaya/ayutthaya/all/582",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/bangkok_and_surrounds/ayutthaya/ayutthaya/all/582",
                "anchor_text": "... Read our full review of Baan Lotus including room rates and direct contact details."
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Baan Lotus",
            "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/bangkok_and_surrounds/ayutthaya/ayutthaya/all/582",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/bangkok_and_surrounds/ayutthaya/ayutthaya/all/582",
                "anchor_text": "Baan Lotus"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Chantana House",
        "main_title": "Where to stay in Ayutthaya",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Relying almost entirely on the walk-in trade, Chanthana House is a family-run place with well-kept budget rooms in an old wood-and-cement house. There are no noisy bars or pushy tour desks here, just a quiet property set back from the road amid gardens and trees.\nDownstairs rooms are clean, simply furnished and reasonably sized, with comfy beds and en-suite hot-water bathrooms. Rooms in the... Read our full review of Chantana House including room rates and direct contact details.",
            "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/bangkok_and_surrounds/ayutthaya/ayutthaya/all/312",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/bangkok_and_surrounds/ayutthaya/ayutthaya/all/312",
                "anchor_text": "... Read our full review of Chantana House including room rates and direct contact details."
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Chantana House",
            "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/bangkok_and_surrounds/ayutthaya/ayutthaya/all/312",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/bangkok_and_surrounds/ayutthaya/ayutthaya/all/312",
                "anchor_text": "Chantana House"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Ayutthaya Guest House",
        "main_title": "Where to stay in Ayutthaya",
